 174+ 679D CD 8D F1         CALL ResolveObjectiveScreen
 175+ 67A0 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 176+ 67A2 32 BA 82         LD (PreviousObjectiveDistance), A
 177+ 67A5 C9               RET
