 174+ 6AC7 3A 4B 6B         LD A, (.lbsBankSave)
 175+ 6ACA E6 07            AND $07                         ; safety: solo bits 0-2
 176+ 6ACC B0               OR B                            ; merge bank en paging
 177+ 6ACD 32 82 90         LD (CurrentPaging), A
