 753+ 75F8              ; .cmcpComputeNeighbor - Calcula V dado R y side, con bounds check
 754+ 75F8              ; ==============================================================================
 755+ 75F8              ; IN:  B = R sid, C = side (0=N,1=S,2=W,3=E)
 756+ 75F8              ; OUT: A = V sid (0..255) si valid; A = $FF si neighbor sale del mapa.
