1569+ 982C              .mulHaveGap:
1570+ 982C                  ; --- Cargar side/coord y traducir a pixel (MaiSpawnX/Y) ---
1571+ 982C 3A CB 9A         LD A, (MulSlot)
1572+ 982F 5F               LD E, A
