4160+ B8C8                  ; Corregir: count × 5 = count × 4 + count
4161+ B8C8 6F               LD L, A
4162+ B8C9 26 00            LD H, 0
4163+ B8CB 54               LD D, H
4164+ B8CC 5D               LD E, L
4165+ B8CD 29               ADD HL, HL
