4529+ BA80 DD 36 01 03      LD (IX+ENT_TYPE), TYPE_NASTY
4530+ BA84 DD 36 02 04      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_SPAWNING
4531+ BA88                  ; Spawn anim segun momento del dia: nocturno (CrepuscularTypeTable) usa
4532+ BA88                  ; SPRID_SPAWN_NIGHT, diurno usa SPRID_SPAWN.
4533+ BA88 3A 8E BF         LD A, (CurrentNastyTable)
