4637+ BB1E
4638+ BB1E 3A 24 BC         LD A, (.spawnSeed)
4639+ BB21 C6 2F            ADD A, 47                   ; Segundo avance (otro primo)
4640+ BB23 32 24 BC         LD (.spawnSeed), A
4641+ BB26 47               LD B, A
4642+ BB27 ED 5F            LD A, R
4643+ BB29 A8               XOR B
4644+ BB2A E6 78            AND $78
4645+ BB2C C6 20            ADD A, SCREEN_MIN_Y + 16
