4659+ BB3F DA FE BB         JP C, .spawnBlocked
4660+ BB42                  ; Y: POSY + (H-1) < SCREEN_MAX_Y (no invadir HUD inferior).
4661+ BB42 DD 7E 04         LD A, (IX+ENT_POSY)
4662+ BB45 47               LD B, A
4663+ BB46 3A 23 BC         LD A, (.spawnH1)
4664+ BB49 80               ADD A, B
