4808+ BC38 ED 5F            LD A, R
4809+ BC3A CB 5F            BIT 3, A
4810+ BC3C 28 07            JR Z, .dyPos
4811+ BC3E 3A 55 90         LD A, (CurrentEnemySpeed)
4812+ BC41 ED 44            NEG
