2268+ DA8E CD 5C DE         CALL DrawBgAttrOnly
2269+ DA91 C3 B4 DC         JP BuildPickupRectCache             ; pickup spawneado in-place: rebuild + clear dirty
2270+ DA94              .rpbpSkipInactive:
