2974+ DE31 07             RLCA
2974+ DE32 07             RLCA
2975+ DE33 57               LD D, A
2976+ DE34 78               LD A, B
2977+ DE35 07               RLCA
2977+ DE36 07             RLCA
2977+ DE37 07             RLCA
