 399+ EEC3 11 31 40         LD DE, $4031                        ; Col 17, row 1, scan 0
 400+ EEC6 DD 21 91 EA      LD IX, BgGfx_hud_clock + 2 + 4      ; Sprite sano, offset 4 (cols 4-5)
 401+ EECA FD 21 02 EB      LD IY, BgGfx_hud_clock_decayed + 2 + 4  ; Sprite marchito, offset 4
