 786+ F09C 6F               LD L, A                     ; HL = dir VRAM destino
 787+ F09D
 788+ F09D                  ; --- Aplicar mask: borrar bits (AND ~mask) ---
 789+ F09D 7A               LD A, D
 790+ F09E 2F               CPL
 791+ F09F A6               AND (HL)
 792+ F0A0 77               LD (HL), A
