 274+ FA61              ; Clink metalico agudo + ring breve + decay rapido, 3 rebotes decrecientes.
 275+ FA61              ; Pitch bajo = mas agudo (semi-periodo); pitchDelta=0 = sostenido,
 276+ FA61              ; +1 = decay tonal. Acortado vs version anterior para minimizar el
 277+ FA61              ; bloqueo de PlaySFX (~1.5 frames a 25fps, antes eran ~3).
 278+ FA61              SFX_KeyDrop:
 279+ FA61 12 05 00 01      DEFB  18,   5,  0, 1          ; clink agudo (noise pitch 5)
 280+ FA65 50 07 00 00      DEFB  80,   7,  0, 0          ; ring 1 sostenido corto: campanita
 281+ FA69 32 07 01 00      DEFB  50,   7,  1, 0          ; ring 1 decay rapido (pitch 7→57)
 282+ FA6D 06 12 00 01      DEFB   6,  18,  0, 1          ; rebote 1: tink metalico
 283+ FA71 32 0A 00 00      DEFB  50,  10,  0, 0          ; ring 2 sostenido
 284+ FA75 23 0B 01 00      DEFB  35,  11,  1, 0          ; ring 2 decay (pitch 11→46)
 285+ FA79 04 18 00 01      DEFB   4,  24,  0, 1          ; rebote 2: tink mas pequeño
 286+ FA7D 23 10 00 00      DEFB  35,  16,  0, 0          ; ring 3 sostenido medio-agudo
 287+ FA81 19 11 01 00      DEFB  25,  17,  1, 0          ; ring 3 decay final (pitch 17→42)
 288+ FA85 00               DEFB   0                       ; fin
 289+ FA86
 290+ FA86              ; --- Sistema de campanadas con pausa entre ellas ---
 291+ FA86              ; Usa la variable de sistema FRAMES ($5C78, 16 bits low) que avanza con cada
 292+ FA86              ; interrupcion de raster — sigue contando aunque PlaySFX bloquee la CPU.
 293+ FA86              ; Asi el ritmo de campanadas se mantiene aunque haya SFX beeper de por medio.
 294+ FA86 00           BellCount:      DEFB 0          ; campanadas restantes (0 = inactivo)
 295+ FA87 00 00        BellNextFrame:  DEFW 0          ; valor de FRAMES en el que toca la siguiente
 296+ FA89              BELL_PAUSE      EQU 75          ; frames de pausa entre campanadas (~1.5s a 50fps)
 297+ FA89              SYS_FRAMES      EQU $5C78       ; ROM system var, contador 16-bit avanza con interrupts
 298+ FA89
 299+ FA89              ; --- Cadena de eventos tras la ultima campanada ---
 300+ FA89              ; last chime → (delay) → windows off → (delay) → monster spawn
 301+ FA89              POST_BELL_WINDOWS_DELAY   EQU 45    ; 45 frames a 25fps = 1.8s (era 90 a 50fps)
 302+ FA89              POST_WINDOWS_SPAWN_DELAY  EQU 38    ; 38 frames a 25fps = 1.5s (era 75 a 50fps)
 303+ FA89 00           BellsDoneTimer:       DEFB 0        ; >0 = contando hasta windows off
 304+ FA8A 00           SpawnAfterWinTimer:   DEFB 0        ; >0 = contando hasta monster spawn
 305+ FA8B
 306+ FA8B              ; ==============================================================================
 307+ FA8B              ; StartBellChimes - Inicia secuencia de 12 campanadas
 308+ FA8B              ; ==============================================================================
 309+ FA8B              StartBellChimes:
 310+ FA8B                  ; Silenciar musica activa (death o cualquier otra). Bell escribe R7 (mixer
 311+ FA8B                  ; all-on), R0-R5 (period A/B/C) y R8-R10 (vols), clobbeando lo que la musica
 312+ FA8B                  ; mantenga en canal B. Mejor parar limpiamente que oir glitches.
 313+ FA8B F5               PUSH AF
 314+ FA8C 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 315+ FA8E CD A0 9C         CALL StartMusic
 316+ FA91 F1               POP AF
 317+ FA92 3E 03            LD A, 3                             ; DEBUG: 3 campanadas (era 12)
 318+ FA94 32 86 FA         LD (BellCount), A
 319+ FA97                  ; Sonar la primera inmediatamente: deadline = FRAMES actual
 320+ FA97 2A 78 5C         LD HL, (SYS_FRAMES)
 321+ FA9A 22 87 FA         LD (BellNextFrame), HL
 322+ FA9D 3E 7D            LD A, SCARE_TIMER_BELLS
 323+ FA9F 32 8E B8         LD (ScareTimer), A
 324+ FAA2 C9               RET
 325+ FAA3
 326+ FAA3              ; ==============================================================================
 327+ FAA3              ; UpdateBellChimes - Llamar cada frame desde el main loop
 328+ FAA3              ; ==============================================================================
 329+ FAA3              UpdateBellChimes:
 330+ FAA3 3A 86 FA         LD A, (BellCount)
 331+ FAA6 B7               OR A
 332+ FAA7 C8               RET Z                       ; sin campanadas pendientes
 333+ FAA8
 334+ FAA8                  ; Comparar FRAMES actual con BellNextFrame
 335+ FAA8 2A 78 5C         LD HL, (SYS_FRAMES)
 336+ FAAB ED 5B 87 FA      LD DE, (BellNextFrame)
 337+ FAAF B7               OR A
 338+ FAB0 ED 52            SBC HL, DE                  ; HL = FRAMES - BellNextFrame
 339+ FAB2 D8               RET C                       ; FRAMES < deadline → aun no toca
 340+ FAB3
 341+ FAB3                  ; Sonar campanada (AY, no bloquea CPU)
 342+ FAB3 C5               PUSH BC
 343+ FAB4 D5               PUSH DE
 344+ FAB5 CD C3 9B         CALL AY_PlayBellChime
 345+ FAB8 D1               POP DE
 346+ FAB9 C1               POP BC
 347+ FABA
 348+ FABA                  ; Resincronizar: deadline siguiente = FRAMES actual + BELL_PAUSE
 349+ FABA                  ; Esto evita acumular drift cuando los SFX bloquean interrupts
 350+ FABA 2A 78 5C         LD HL, (SYS_FRAMES)
 351+ FABD 11 4B 00         LD DE, BELL_PAUSE
 352+ FAC0 19               ADD HL, DE
 353+ FAC1 22 87 FA         LD (BellNextFrame), HL
 354+ FAC4
 355+ FAC4 21 86 FA         LD HL, BellCount
 356+ FAC7 35               DEC (HL)
 357+ FAC8 C0               RET NZ
 358+ FAC9 18 00            JR .bellsDone
 359+ FACB
 360+ FACB              .bellsDone:
 361+ FACB                  ; Ultima campanada:
 362+ FACB                  ;   1) matar todos los nasties vivos (puff)
 363+ FACB                  ;   2) arrancar cadena diferida: windows off → monster spawn
 364+ FACB CD CD BC         CALL KillAllActiveNasties
 365+ FACE 3E 2D            LD A, POST_BELL_WINDOWS_DELAY
 366+ FAD0 32 89 FA         LD (BellsDoneTimer), A
 367+ FAD3 C9               RET
 368+ FAD4
 369+ FAD4              ; ==============================================================================
 370+ FAD4              ; UpdateBellsDoneTimer - Llamar cada frame tras UpdateBellChimes
 371+ FAD4              ; ==============================================================================
 372+ FAD4              ; Maneja la cadena diferida tras la ultima campanada:
 373+ FAD4              ;   1) BellsDoneTimer cuenta hasta 0 → apagar ventanas (UpdateRemapTables)
 374+ FAD4              ;      y arranca SpawnAfterWinTimer
 375+ FAD4              ;   2) SpawnAfterWinTimer cuenta hasta 0 → SpawnMonsters
 376+ FAD4              ; ==============================================================================
 377+ FAD4              UpdateBellsDoneTimer:
 378+ FAD4 3A 89 FA         LD A, (BellsDoneTimer)
 379+ FAD7 B7               OR A
 380+ FAD8 28 21            JR Z, .ubdCheckSpawn
 381+ FADA 3D               DEC A
 382+ FADB 32 89 FA         LD (BellsDoneTimer), A
 383+ FADE 20 1B            JR NZ, .ubdCheckSpawn
 384+ FAE0                  ; Llego a 0: apagar ventanas
 385+ FAE0 CD 74 E5         CALL UpdateRemapTables
 386+ FAE3 3E 01            LD A, 1
 387+ FAE5 32 11 83         LD (AttrsDirty), A
 388+ FAE8                  ; Si las campanadas las disparo el jugador abriendo la iglesia (i.e.
 389+ FAE8                  ; ChurchDoorOpen=1 al terminar bells), resaltar la estatua del
 390+ FAE8                  ; monstruo esperado. Si fueron campanadas naturales de medianoche,
 391+ FAE8                  ; ChurchDoorOpen sigue en 0 y este call es no-op.
 392+ FAE8 3A B1 82         LD A, (ChurchDoorOpen)
 393+ FAEB B7               OR A
 394+ FAEC 28 03            JR Z, .ubdSkipHighlight
 395+ FAEE CD D7 F4         CALL StartStatueBlink
 396+ FAF1              .ubdSkipHighlight:
 397+ FAF1 3E 26            LD A, POST_WINDOWS_SPAWN_DELAY
 398+ FAF3 32 8A FA         LD (SpawnAfterWinTimer), A
 399+ FAF6                  ; Musica de tension organica entre lights-off y monster spawn (track 0)
 400+ FAF6 AF               XOR A                           ; A = 0 = MUSIC_TENSION
 401+ FAF7 CD A0 9C         CALL StartMusic
 402+ FAFA C9               RET
 403+ FAFB              .ubdCheckSpawn:
 404+ FAFB 3A 8A FA         LD A, (SpawnAfterWinTimer)
 405+ FAFE B7               OR A
 406+ FAFF C8               RET Z
 407+ FB00 3D               DEC A
 408+ FB01 32 8A FA         LD (SpawnAfterWinTimer), A
 409+ FB04 C0               RET NZ
 410+ FB05                  ; Llego a 0: spawnear monsters
 411+ FB05 C3 EC BF         JP SpawnMonsters
 412+ FB08
